{
  "_about": "Side-car for tools/eval/Recurate.csx. Maps each ev-* question id in data/eval/wizard.v1.jsonl to the canonical OPDB machine title used to look up the actual deployed-Cosmos OPDB id. Out-of-scope rows (acceptable_refusal=true) and the pure-OOS Wizard row have machine_title=null — the recuration script leaves their expected_citation_set as []. The script issues a cross-partition case-insensitive STRINGEQUALS query on c.title (mirrors IMachineRepository.QueryByTitleAsync) so the curator does NOT need to know which manufacturer-partition OPDB filed the machine under (e.g., the Stern-released Godzilla 2021 is under partition `sega`, not `stern`, in the deployed catalog). Curated 2026-05-08; commit alongside the recuration PR so a future audit can trace why a given question maps to a given title.",
